WEBVTT

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:02.879
Gumagamit ang bawat aralin dito ng buwanang kita na

00:00:02.879 --> 00:00:07.737
five thousand pesos hanggang fifteen thousand pesos Kasama na

00:00:07.763 --> 00:00:12.263
dito ang pension savings at tulong ng pamilya Papalitan

00:00:12.355 --> 00:00:15.224
ito ng sarili ninyong numero po kung saan mayroon

00:00:15.224 --> 00:00:15.763
si Jinnie

00:00:20.611 --> 00:00:24.627
Nag-sisenta na po kayo Tumigil na kayo sa pagtatrabaho

00:00:25.614 --> 00:00:28.798
Sabi ng kapitbahay kailangan pa raw ninyong maghintay hanggang

00:00:28.798 --> 00:00:29.719
sesenta-singko

00:00:34.594 --> 00:00:39.149
Pagpipilian ang animnapu hindi patakaran Kayo po ang magpapasya

00:00:39.162 --> 00:00:40.360
kung kailan titigil
